        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kendrick Lamar, DJ Dahi, Drake, Jay Rock\n- Songs: Money Trees, Untitled 08 – 09.06.2014., Worst Behavior\n- Albums: Section.80, Good Kid, M.A.A.D City, untitled unmastered.\n- Topics: hip hop, jazz rap, music production\n\nFacts:\n- Kendrick Lamar released his debut studio album Section.80 in 2011 as an independent album exclusively through the iTunes Store.\n- Kendrick Lamar released Good Kid, M.A.A.D City in 2012 as his second studio album.\n- Money Trees is a song by Kendrick Lamar from his major-label debut studio album Good Kid, M.A.A.D City.\n- DJ Dahi is noted for producing Money Trees by Kendrick Lamar, which features Jay Rock.\n- DJ Dahi is also known for producing Worst Behavior by Drake.\n- Untitled 08 – 09.06.2014., previously titled Untitled 2, is a jazz rap song by Kendrick Lamar featured on the compilation album untitled unmastered.",
